From 134d1dd211dcfb91132518777ec6ba5e13c9a25d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 18:18:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 241/256] fix(execution): reconcile runtime/document-derived
 report echoes (0042 item 1c)

- reconcile R1-R9 in-document pairs: resolution.degraded vs
  fallback_events, dispatch.threads_used and resolved_policy resources
  vs selected/invoked candidate checks and runtime copies, resolved scope,
  error budget presence/guarantees.error_budget, guarantee basis, and
  layout_decision.stride_class vs the selected candidate
- portable resolved.implementation/artifact.provider_artifact_digest are
  code constants (must-reject); vendor values stay a registered boundary
- anchor the selected candidate by stable state (never index), require its
  threads/stride_class checks, echo determinism, and refuse unknown named
  rule detail keys
- drop the duplicated 1b2 runtime/candidate blocks left by the handoff
- tests: portable cross-block cases, vendor and genuine-fallback cases
